{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Tesla showed a Roadster driving upside down, then briefly airborne.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.65,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.1",
      "samples": 111600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-2",
      "transcript": "But those are two different engineering tricks.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 5.033333333333333,
      "duration": 2.9,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.2",
      "samples": 69600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Tesla says fans remove air from beneath the car.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 8.2,
      "duration": 3.45,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.3",
      "samples": 82800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Lower pressure underneath lets outside air press it against the surface.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 11.933333333333334,
      "duration": 4.875,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.4",
      "samples": 117000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Upside down, that force must beat gravity.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 17.133333333333333,
      "duration": 3.225,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.5",
      "samples": 77400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Tesla attributes the airborne motion to cold-gas thrusters.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 20.733333333333334,
      "duration": 4.3,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.6",
      "samples": 103200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-7",
      "transcript": "They release compressed air. Gas shoots one way; the car is pushed the other.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 25.3,
      "duration": 4.95,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.7",
      "samples": 118800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Different jet directions can change its motion. Off-center pushes can turn it.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 30.566666666666666,
      "duration": 5.325,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.8",
      "samples": 127800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-9",
      "transcript": "But the stored gas is limited.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 36.266666666666666,
      "duration": 2.3,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.9",
      "samples": 55200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "roadster-cue-10",
      "transcript": "A short, controlled maneuver is not proof of sustained, practical flight.",
      "file": "audio/roadster/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 38.86666666666667,
      "duration": 4.925,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "roadster.asset.physics.script.10",
      "samples": 118200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
